WEBVTT

00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Typically, what you're going to see in a supplement, if you go to the store,

00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:08,640
buy a vitamin E supplement, I'll say alpha to cough or all, or mixed to cough orals, or alpha,

00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:16,640
beta, gamma, delta, to cough or all. But it's the to cough orals that are not the ones you want

00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:21,680
to use. If you have heart conditions, it's not the ones that you want to use for cancer.

00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:28,000
It's the inner portion of the vitamin E. Those are the total triadols, kind of confusing.

00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:34,080
The total triadols are the inner portions and the to cough orals are the outer portions. It's very

00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:40,000
easy to synthesize those outer portions, the to cough orals in the laboratory. That's why you're

00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:48,400
going to see them in store bought vitamins usually. The toco triadols, the inner portion, it's typically,

00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:55,200
that's not typically, it's specifically the gamma and delta toco triadols, that are the important

00:00:55,200 --> 00:01:01,040
components of the vitamin E that is good for cancer and good for the heart. There's several studies

00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:09,760
of the gamma and delta toco triadols for cancer and for the heart, and you can certainly just

00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:19,040
google scholar those studies as well. They're very impressive.

